cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Endogenous freight modal shift in TEMOA-Italy
message: >-
  If you use this work, please cite it as below, together with TEMOA-Italy
  (https://github.com/MAHTEP/TEMOA-Italy).
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Filippo
    family-names: Cinquini
  - given-names: Cristiano
    family-names: Chiapparoli
abstract: >-
  An extension of the TEMOA-Italy energy system optimization model that splits
  road freight into five distance classes and adds an endogenous modal-shift
  layer between long-haul road freight, rail and domestic navigation.
keywords:
  - energy system optimization
  - TEMOA
  - Italy
  - freight transport
  - modal shift
